{
  "description": "GET /api/tests/test/{test_id}/runs?group_by=commit: the grid query, one grouped read of a test's runs with its jobs' and workflow runs' latest metadata. Each case records the raw request, the fixed window start (since_ms, Unix milliseconds; the handler computes it from the request time), the generated SQL and bindings, EXPLAIN plans, alternating timing samples of the kept query and the rejected rewrite without FINAL on the metadata reads, and a summary of the rows.",
